      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>Collection by R. Baruch, w(eek of) &ldquo;In the Beginning&rdquo; (Genesis 1:1)</li>\n<li>R. Yosef and his partner in waraq 5</li>\n<li>the Elder Mufa\u1e0d\u1e0dal the goldsmith (or silversmith) in waraq 1</li>\n<li>the Elder Ab\u016b Is\u1e25aq of Palestine in waraq 1</li>\n<li>al-Thiqa Hiba, street of the greengrocers 1</li>\n<li>al-Rashid Abu\u02bel-Fa\u1e0dl b. al-Ahuv (son of &ldquo;the Beloved [of the Yeshiva]&rdquo;) 1/2</li>\n<li>Yosef the cook 1/2</li>\n<li>Bu\u02bel-\u02bfIzz the dyer 1/2</li>\n<li>Yosef the gold/silversmith Khi\u1e0d\u0101bi (seller of dyestuff) 1/4</li>\n<li>[Bu]\u02bel-Faraj the Kohen 1/2</li>\n<li>Bishr the dyer 1</li>\n<li>Ab\u016b Sa\u02bfd son of the captive 1</li>\n<li>b. al-Rib\u0101\u1e6d 1/2</li>\n<li>Bu\u02bel-\u02bfIzz&nbsp;father of the Rayyis 1/2</li>\n<li>the Elder Abu\u02bel-Ma\u02bf\u0101l\u012b b. al-Dayy\u0101n (the son of the judge), (may his) m(emory be) b(lessed) 2</li>\n<li>Ab\u016b Na\u1e63r the son of Karam the banker 1 2</li>\n<li>the \u1e25aver Abu\u02bel-\u02bfAl\u0101\u02be&nbsp;the banker 9</li>\n<li>al-Levi b. al-Mak\u012bn the druggist 1/2 Thursday</li>\n<li>Bu\u02bel-\u02bfAl\u0101\u02be, in the Great Market 1/2</li>\n<li>the Kohen Mu\u02bfammar 1/2</li>\n<li>Mufa\u1e0d\u1e0dal, in the Great Market 1</li>\n<li>Mak\u0101rim the oculist 1 1/8 and some copper coins 1/4</li>\n<li>Abu\u02bel-\u1e24asan the greengroce[r] [. . .]</li>\n<li>the son of [. . .] 1/2</li>\n<li>Abu\u02bel-Faraj the son of al-Ra\u1e63uy (&ldquo;Desired [by the Yeshiva]&rdquo;) 1</li>\n<li>&nbsp;al-Mak\u012bn Mufa\u1e0d\u1e0dal the sugar maker/seller 3</li>\n<li>B\u016b Man\u1e63\u016br son of the captive 1/2</li>\n<li>B\u016b Shab\u012bb 1 1/2</li>\n<li>36 1/2</li></ol>\n",
